  "description": "Supademo's MCP server connects Claude directly to your Supademo workspace, so you can build and manage product demos without leaving the conversation.\n\nCreate and edit demos, steps, hotspots, and chapters. Generate AI voiceovers for an entire demo in one pass. Bulk-create trackable links from a spreadsheet of contacts. Organize demos into folders, move them in bulk, and set backgrounds, branding, and display settings.\n\nBeyond individual demos, manage full Demo Hubs and Showcases — curated collections combining multiple demos with categories, analytics, and sharing controls. Pull performance data (views, engagement, hotspot clicks, device breakdowns) for any demo or showcase. Generate translations for existing demos, or import steps from one demo into another.",
